<title>USA: EFI meets NASDAQ requirements.</title>
<headline>EFI meets NASDAQ requirements.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>EFI Electronics Corp said on Tuesday that it complied with NASDAQ's required actions to increase capital and surplus requirements in order to continue the company's listing.</p>
<p>After EFI Electronics failed to meet requirements as of June 30, the company was granted a temporary exception.</p>
<p>The conditions, however, were met by EFI Electronics by the sale of equity and conversion of outstanding debt to equity.</p>
<p>Effective September 25, EFI Electronics NASDAQ symbol would revert back to &quot;EFIC.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
